# Clance environment. Copy to `.env` and fill in; `.env` is gitignored and
# is read once at startup (see src/main/env.ts). Nothing here is required —
# Clance runs without any of it, with the feature it belongs to degraded
# rather than disabled.

# The assistant's decision service (⌥A). Clance sends it the command you
# spoke, the name and window title of the app in front, and the list of
# things it could do — never your documents, your field contents, or
# anything you dictate. Without a key the assistant falls back to local
# matching, which recognises common phrasings and hands the rest to Claude.
# Key: https://typesafe.ai
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides, only if you have been told to change them.
# TYPESAFE_BASE_URL=https://api.typesafe.ai
# TYPESAFE_DEFAULT_MODEL=jev-latest
